anatomy-grok-bot
================

This plugin packages "Anatomy", an open-source agent skill and kit for
isometric technical figures.

Original work:  Anatomy, by Ryan (@wheresryan22)
Source:         https://github.com/wheresryan22/anatomy
Upstream commit: dbf697a527bbf7d358668e1557cb1e35ff725d46 (2026-10-10)
License:        MIT (see LICENSE; the original copyright notice is kept intact)

Packaged by:    Pedro Gonzalez / Blueforce Innovations

Changes from upstream:
- Laid out as a Cursor plugin: .cursor-plugin/plugin.json, skills/anatomy/.
- skills/anatomy/SKILL.md is the upstream SKILL.md with one added section,
  "Running this skill from the plugin" (path resolution, requirements,
  sanity check, and field-tested gotchas).
- kit/, scripts/, references/ and examples/ sources are copied unchanged.
- Prebuilt example HTML pages, evals/, .github/ and repository meta files
  were left out to keep the plugin small; every example rebuilds with
  `node examples/<name>/build.mjs`.
- Added README.md, CREDITS.md, NOTICE, assets/logo.svg and screenshots.

This is an independent packaging and is not an official release by the
original author. assets/dial-indicator.webp is from the upstream repository.
assets/screenshot-rotary-engine.png is a figure made with the kit by the packager.
